{"script":"sj_014_01","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1","mirrow":false,"x":426,"trans":true,"y":-31,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1c","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":426,"trans":true,"y":-31,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1c","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]不愧是老大，从任何方面看都挑不出毛病！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]尤其是选址，地理位置隐蔽，旁边的这个山壁让攻防战的时候十分利于防守。设施也很齐全，就算库存不多，也可以自给自足维持围城状态下少人数的坚守。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]你说我这方面的经验很丰富？嗨，也不算是什么好事。要不是生活所迫，谁又愿意懂这些呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]我们村子从来没少过麻烦，有时候是外来者造成的，有时候是魔物造成的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]打从我记事起，自卫团就没有闲下来过哪怕一天。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]不止要防守已经形成的威胁，在不怎么太平的年份，我们甚至要主动去骚扰别人，来预防还没形成的威胁。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]嘿嘿，真羡慕老大，住在这么舒适的地界，还有个这么好的营地。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"皮塔","text":"[show]好啦，不说这些丧气话了。既然当下能这么惬意，就好好享受当下吧！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara014_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":426,"trans":true,"y":-31,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara014_1_face_chara014_1c","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"皮塔-对我们的营地感觉如何？"}